        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "97c2b737-5837-5d84-b830-4a98e2f0bde9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Vienna, Neuschloss, Bohemia\n- Organizations: Flex, Waves Vienna\n- People: High Contrast, Lincoln Barrett, Emilie Bach, Pendulum, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, Leopoi\n- Topics: Drum and bass, electronic music\n\nFacts:\n- Emilie Bach was born in Neuschloss, Bohemia, on July 2, 1840.\n- Emilie Bach was an artist and journalist, and she died in Vienna on April 29, 1890.\n- High Contrast is the stage name of Lincoln Barrett, who was born on 18 September 1979.\n- Lincoln Barrett is a Welsh electronic music producer, DJ, and record producer.\n- Flex is a nightclub in Vienna.\n- Flex has hosted hundreds of visits from drum and bass DJs including Pendulum, High Contrast, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, and Leopoi.\n- Waves Vienna takes place across music venues in Vienna such as Fluc, Flex, and Odeon.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "d3d85376-8e3c-532e-8d8d-99c34e732bec",
        "text": "Page: Flex (club). Sentence: Flex is a nightclub in Vienna.\nPage: Flex (club). Sentence: There have been hundreds of visits from drum and bass DJs like: Pendulum, High Contrast, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, Leopoi, and others.\nPage: High Contrast. Sentence: Lincoln Barrett, better known by the stage name High Contrast (born 18 September 1979), is a Welsh electronic music producer DJ and record producer.\nPage: Waves Vienna. Sentence: The festival takes place in a series of music venues in Vienna such as the Fluc, Flex and Odeon.\nPage: Emilie Bach. Sentence: Emilie Bach (born Neuschloss, Bohemia, July 2, 1840; died Vienna April 29, 1890) was an artist and journalist.",
